Package: com.ma6x9x.kernellab
Name: Kernellab
Version: 0.2.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: userspace micro-lab for iOS/XNU kernel research. Pick a saved
 kernelcache (target.json), survivor-diff pinned method tables across two
 builds, and dry-run the allowlisted userspace stub (sim ident). Fleet
 tags follow the hunt pack (23F77, 23G71, 21D50, 24A435, 24A437, 24B119)
 and a build with no pinned entry is a refusal. The Apple-submit gate
 stays closed. No kernelcaches included (operator-supplied). An emulated
 result is not a device receipt.
Maintainer: kolby <noreply@github.com>
Author: kolbymaxx
Section: Research
Depends: python3
Homepage: https://github.com/ma6x9x/KernelLab
